WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,880
I just stopped by to cook a hot meal for you.

2
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:06,880
I wash the rice and you cook the vegetables

3
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:10,780
You always watch what I do

4
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:12,140
The vegetables are almost burnt

5
00:00:13,390 --> 00:00:15,350
Look at how my future wife cooks

6
00:00:15,670 --> 00:00:21,020
Can you taste the heat?

7
00:00:23,210 --> 00:00:24,130
Very delicious

8
00:00:24,210 --> 00:00:28,420
Xiao Xi is better than the chef at Guoying Hotel

9
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:29,820
One month left

10
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:32,850
You are my wife, Brother Qin

11
00:00:33,250 --> 00:00:34,850
I will try my best to be a good wife

12
00:00:35,090 --> 00:00:38,870
Take good care of our home Xiao Xi

13
00:00:39,510 --> 00:00:41,390
Xiyan promised to control the purchase of wine and meat for everyone

14
00:00:41,510 --> 00:00:42,750
It must not contain acid

15
00:00:43,390 --> 00:00:49,020
I want to go into the mountains tonight but

16
00:00:49,730 --> 00:00:54,860
It's too dangerous to go into the mountains at night, don't be afraid

17
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:57,220
I'm only on the periphery

18
00:00:57,540 --> 00:00:58,500
Go quickly and come back quickly
